{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301190","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1230119001:1":{"text":"안개가 걷힌 뒤로 배를 수리하는 사람들이 늘어났어요.","source_cn":"自从迷雾消散之后，修船的人就多了起来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9049ED728DA3D7E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230119002:1":{"text":"제가 그렇게 서두르지 말라고 설득했지만, 그래도 여전히 줄이 기네요.","source_cn":"尽管我全力劝解他们修船不急于一时，可修船的人还是排起长队。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0233C195B35F70C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230119003:1":{"text":"서두르지 말라니? 자네는 지난 반년 동안 어부들이 얼마나 힘들었는지 모르는 건가?","source_cn":"不急于一时？你是不知道这半年我们这些渔夫的处境有多难？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74313506DAAF9221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230119004:1":{"text":"모르긴요! 그래도 줄은 서주셔야 한다고요!","source_cn":"我怎么不知道？可就算再难你也要给我排队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C1F1E9004BAEBBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠埃隆阿":{"text":"장인 에로나","source":"工匠埃隆阿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:渔夫塔富林":{"text":"어부 테이린","source":"渔夫塔富林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}